(5729292, 833873, 51793, '<td valign="top">I see the rainbow but this picture looks really bad. You have a red hand, our of focus trees, sensor dust that could have been removed, a rainbow that is barely seen and a sky that over powers everything but the hand. <br/> <br/>Try using a flash to light your hand and an exposure that properly illuminates the background. The wider your aperture the longer your focus length becomes. Play around with it and adjust the settings until you get better at it.</td>', 'I see the rainbow but this picture looks really bad. You have a red hand, our of focus trees, sensor dust that could have been removed, a rainbow that is barely seen and a sky that over powers everything but the hand.  Try using a flash to light your hand and an exposure that properly illuminates the background. The wider your aperture the longer your focus length becomes. Play around with it and adjust the settings until you get better at it.', '2009-11-16 15:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5729297, 833854, 51793, '<td valign="top">It does have the colors of the rainbow and it is nicely shot but I''m sure you could have come up with a better subject. This has been shot many times before and it''s getting boring. <br/> <br/>BTW I would have sharpened all the tips to make it a little better.</td>', 'It does have the colors of the rainbow and it is nicely shot but I''m sure you could have come up with a better subject. This has been shot many times before and it''s getting boring.  BTW I would have sharpened all the tips to make it a little better.', '2009-11-16 15:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
