(5730866, 833593, 111808, '<td valign="top">This evokes a feeling of quiet serenity and peace. It has the colours of the Rainbow contained within it in a unique presentation, not just a direct arc. It is joy to view and a different way of interpreting the challenge. Beautifully done.</td>', 'This evokes a feeling of quiet serenity and peace. It has the colours of the Rainbow contained within it in a unique presentation, not just a direct arc. It is joy to view and a different way of interpreting the challenge. Beautifully done.', '2009-11-17 19:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730880, 833227, 111808, '<td valign="top">Rainbow colours crafted out of interesting textures and yummy edibles (though not necessarily at the same time) - creative &amp; delightful. Lemon yellow, Pumpkin orange, Berry blue, Pomegranate red, Pepper green &amp; Cabbage purple - a truly unique complementary arc. The grass sprigs &amp; curled leaf bed remind one yet that this is an Autumn cornucopia. Well done.</td>', 'Rainbow colours crafted out of interesting textures and yummy edibles (though not necessarily at the same time) - creative & delightful. Lemon yellow, Pumpkin orange, Berry blue, Pomegranate red, Pepper green & Cabbage purple - a truly unique complementary arc. The grass sprigs & curled leaf bed remind one yet that this is an Autumn cornucopia. Well done.', '2009-11-17 19:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730885, 833890, 111808, '<td valign="top">Outstanding colours in the curves and the black background enhances it nicely. The patterns change also, making the rainbow unpredictable.</td>', 'Outstanding colours in the curves and the black background enhances it nicely. The patterns change also, making the rainbow unpredictable.', '2009-11-17 20:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730894, 833666, 111808, '<td valign="top">Knot your normal rainbow colours either, but beautiful all the same. I like how each scarf gets progressively longer in the parallel arc and the knots go from larger to smaller in inverse proportion, and that their bottom edges are jaggy not grounded. Creatively thought outside the box.</td>', 'Knot your normal rainbow colours either, but beautiful all the same. I like how each scarf gets progressively longer in the parallel arc and the knots go from larger to smaller in inverse proportion, and that their bottom edges are jaggy not grounded. Creatively thought outside the box.', '2009-11-17 20:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730908, 833816, 111808, '<td valign="top">Superbly crafted night shot, very sharp with the dazzling rainbow light reflections in the water. Excellent cityscape, I found myself studying the various buildings &amp; signs more than the water but the urban colours make a balanced whole. This is a photograph where the eye can travel around it looking at textures &amp; juxtapositions for a long while.</td>', 'Superbly crafted night shot, very sharp with the dazzling rainbow light reflections in the water. Excellent cityscape, I found myself studying the various buildings & signs more than the water but the urban colours make a balanced whole. This is a photograph where the eye can travel around it looking at textures & juxtapositions for a long while.', '2009-11-17 20:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730942, 833658, 111808, '<td valign="top">The weathered textures &amp; colours on this wall are delightfully diverse, and the shapes of the fishbobbers echo the curved bush as well. The square of the window that you can almost see into echoes the individual shingles of the siding which makes up the building. Masterfully done, a veritable used colours seafood inspired rainbow.</td>', 'The weathered textures & colours on this wall are delightfully diverse, and the shapes of the fishbobbers echo the curved bush as well. The square of the window that you can almost see into echoes the individual shingles of the siding which makes up the building. Masterfully done, a veritable used colours seafood inspired rainbow.', '2009-11-17 20:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730945, 833352, 110644, '<td valign="top">very nice... have you thought of cropping off the extra sky from top...</td>', 'very nice... have you thought of cropping off the extra sky from top...', '2009-11-17 20:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730948, 833666, 43088, '<td valign="top">I might have had the scafs vertical instead of horizontal. Otherwise very nicely done.</td>', 'I might have had the scafs vertical instead of horizontal. Otherwise very nicely done.', '2009-11-17 20:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730950, 833816, 43088, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot. Might try a little longer exposure- show a bit more detail in the buildings.</td>', 'Nice night shot. Might try a little longer exposure- show a bit more detail in the buildings.', '2009-11-17 20:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730952, 833674, 110644, '<td valign="top">good art</td>', 'good art', '2009-11-17 20:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730954, 833681, 110644, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2009-11-17 20:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730955, 833593, 43088, '<td valign="top">Great shot of La Jolla! Just after sunset? There have been some nice colors to the evening sky lately. Best time of year for photography here in my opinion.</td>', 'Great shot of La Jolla! Just after sunset? There have been some nice colors to the evening sky lately. Best time of year for photography here in my opinion.', '2009-11-17 20:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5730957, 833785, 111808, '<td valign="top">Love the brilliant colours in this presentation of crayons in their unique holders. They are sharp and beautifully layered and some have been favoured &amp; more used. A definite favourite of rainbow Art.</td>', 'Love the brilliant colours in this presentation of crayons in their unique holders. They are sharp and beautifully layered and some have been favoured & more used. A definite favourite of rainbow Art.', '2009-11-17 20:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
