(5732692, 833576, 91496, '<td valign="top">Love the crazy abstractness of this image.  Solid yellow area in upper right needs kind of unbalances it.</td>', 'Love the crazy abstractness of this image.  Solid yellow area in upper right needs kind of unbalances it.', '2009-11-18 17:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732694, 833796, 91496, '<td valign="top">Well done.  You angle is great and I like whatever soft foucs or processing you have done to to give it this edgy look.  Not a fan of the border the white lines are a distraction.</td>', 'Well done.  You angle is great and I like whatever soft foucs or processing you have done to to give it this edgy look.  Not a fan of the border the white lines are a distraction.', '2009-11-18 17:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732695, 833832, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the upper part where the stripes are. Not sure a photo of a shirt print really shows off your talents and creativity.</td>', 'I like the upper part where the stripes are. Not sure a photo of a shirt print really shows off your talents and creativity.', '2009-11-18 17:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732699, 833307, 91496, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the backdrop with all the swirly lines and colors. The guy seems to be so secondary to the crazy colors that he is almost invisable, which leave me mostly voting on a picture of a picture.</td>', 'Absolutely love the backdrop with all the swirly lines and colors. The guy seems to be so secondary to the crazy colors that he is almost invisable, which leave me mostly voting on a picture of a picture.', '2009-11-18 17:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732704, 833682, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the angles that you picked here, it shows you were looking for a creative viewpoint.  Most portions of the image are out of focus, which can be pleasing, but usaully they have to be more out of focus than this to really work.</td>', 'I like the angles that you picked here, it shows you were looking for a creative viewpoint.  Most portions of the image are out of focus, which can be pleasing, but usaully they have to be more out of focus than this to really work.', '2009-11-18 17:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732706, 833873, 91496, '<td valign="top">The sky is cool with lots of interesting shapes.  The disembodied hand does not work for me and just seems out of place.  I think you have 2-3 dust specks visable in the sky which could be cloned/healed if you do post processing.</td>', 'The sky is cool with lots of interesting shapes.  The disembodied hand does not work for me and just seems out of place.  I think you have 2-3 dust specks visable in the sky which could be cloned/healed if you do post processing.', '2009-11-18 17:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732711, 833814, 91496, '<td valign="top">Wow this is crazy outside the box and has some very interesting visuals. It might be a little too far outside the box to really do well in a challenge.</td>', 'Wow this is crazy outside the box and has some very interesting visuals. It might be a little too far outside the box to really do well in a challenge.', '2009-11-18 17:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732715, 833678, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the "v" formed by the cars and people and the sky is quite lovely.  Seems to be missing a emphassis on the rainbow of colors, except in one small area.</td>', 'I like the "v" formed by the cars and people and the sky is quite lovely.  Seems to be missing a emphassis on the rainbow of colors, except in one small area.', '2009-11-18 17:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732720, 832794, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the face that the lady is drawing.  Seems like there are too many elements/angles/lines in the images to tell a cohesive story.</td>', 'I like the face that the lady is drawing.  Seems like there are too many elements/angles/lines in the images to tell a cohesive story.', '2009-11-18 17:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732727, 833827, 91496, '<td valign="top">Not really sure about this one.  There is a vague rainbow connection, but no colors to see.  The graphic looks out of place and rock/backdrop is not all that photogenic.</td>', 'Not really sure about this one.  There is a vague rainbow connection, but no colors to see.  The graphic looks out of place and rock/backdrop is not all that photogenic.', '2009-11-18 17:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732728, 833508, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like what you went after here, with all the colors and the lines/shapes.  However the scene is a bit busy and has no real subject.  Perhaps moving closer to s single subject within the scene would have more impact.</td>', 'I like what you went after here, with all the colors and the lines/shapes.  However the scene is a bit busy and has no real subject.  Perhaps moving closer to s single subject within the scene would have more impact.', '2009-11-18 17:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732732, 833870, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.  I like the ways they progress downwards at an angle.  I wonder if a more steep angle and more overlap between them would have created more impact.  Vignette is not to my taste here.</td>', 'Cool idea.  I like the ways they progress downwards at an angle.  I wonder if a more steep angle and more overlap between them would have created more impact.  Vignette is not to my taste here.', '2009-11-18 17:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732739, 833865, 91496, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here.  The crayons are exploding out of the rainbow! The focus and/or light here is making things a little soft/blurred.  I have noticed that these kinds of photos need almost a perfect setup to score really well (new crayons with perfect tips, crayons all lined with no gaps, a printed inkjet rainbow instead of hand drawn, etc.)</td>', 'I like the idea here.  The crayons are exploding out of the rainbow! The focus and/or light here is making things a little soft/blurred.  I have noticed that these kinds of photos need almost a perfect setup to score really well (new crayons with perfect tips, crayons all lined with no gaps, a printed inkjet rainbow instead of hand drawn, etc.)', '2009-11-18 17:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732746, 833241, 91496, '<td valign="top">I am of two minds on this one.  The flower is super.  It leads you through the frame and has a big burst of color in the middle.  The shadow however is the downer for me, as it distracts the eye away from the flower.</td>', 'I am of two minds on this one.  The flower is super.  It leads you through the frame and has a big burst of color in the middle.  The shadow however is the downer for me, as it distracts the eye away from the flower.', '2009-11-18 17:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5732780, 833827, 107190, '<td valign="top">Okay then....I think this is a really cool idea, but the dreariness of the background and the tombstone ''rainbow'' is a bit dark (in the satirical sense) &amp; I usually enjoy satire, I guess I''m too much of a Judy Garland fan....</td>', 'Okay then....I think this is a really cool idea, but the dreariness of the background and the tombstone ''rainbow'' is a bit dark (in the satirical sense) & I usually enjoy satire, I guess I''m too much of a Judy Garland fan....', '2009-11-18 18:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733075, 833816, 56579, '<td valign="top">Image does not look level, right side looks lower than the left.  Sadly I imagine you did not rotate it because it would cut off the tall building.  I had to give a 6 instead of a 7 because of this.</td>', 'Image does not look level, right side looks lower than the left.  Sadly I imagine you did not rotate it because it would cut off the tall building.  I had to give a 6 instead of a 7 because of this.', '2009-11-18 22:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
