(5733083, 833827, 56579, '<td valign="top">I assume your going for a gay joke?  Ether way I feel the photo lacks quality.  I imagine many will vote for DNMC, but personally I just feel the focus is soft and the image feels awkward.</td>', 'I assume your going for a gay joke?  Ether way I feel the photo lacks quality.  I imagine many will vote for DNMC, but personally I just feel the focus is soft and the image feels awkward.', '2009-11-18 22:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
