(5733247, 832928, 110600, '<td valign="top">Spot on!  :-)</td>', 'Spot on!  :-)', '2009-11-19 04:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733259, 833023, 84668, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and technically it looks ok, but there is something that lacks to me that I don''t feel that I want to give 9 or 10. I think maybe it''s how the they are lit. Anyway, it''s a really good photo that I gave a 8.</td>', 'I like the idea and technically it looks ok, but there is something that lacks to me that I don''t feel that I want to give 9 or 10. I think maybe it''s how the they are lit. Anyway, it''s a really good photo that I gave a 8.', '2009-11-19 05:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733261, 833022, 84668, '<td valign="top">It''s very interesting, good catch on the colored bricks. Don''t know if you have had the opportunity, but you should try the same with matural light, I guess it would look better. 7.</td>', 'It''s very interesting, good catch on the colored bricks. Don''t know if you have had the opportunity, but you should try the same with matural light, I guess it would look better. 7.', '2009-11-19 05:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733264, 833624, 84668, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the execution looks well done. I''ve seen however more interesting compositions with more interesting smoke formats. In short, you should have tried to get more contrast in more parts inside the smoke, like that one that you got on the upper center. Even with this format that you used, I think the composition would be improved if you haven''t cut the smoke in the upper right. Anyway I like it and gave it a 7.</td>', 'I like the idea and the execution looks well done. I''ve seen however more interesting compositions with more interesting smoke formats. In short, you should have tried to get more contrast in more parts inside the smoke, like that one that you got on the upper center. Even with this format that you used, I think the composition would be improved if you haven''t cut the smoke in the upper right. Anyway I like it and gave it a 7.', '2009-11-19 05:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733266, 833885, 84668, '<td valign="top">The composition is very good, however I see few impact because of the lighting. Looks like it could be highly improved with the right editing steps. Maybe a bit of topaz would help to pop the colors and contrast a little bit more. 6.</td>', 'The composition is very good, however I see few impact because of the lighting. Looks like it could be highly improved with the right editing steps. Maybe a bit of topaz would help to pop the colors and contrast a little bit more. 6.', '2009-11-19 05:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733267, 832883, 84668, '<td valign="top">if this corn is true, I did not know it exists. The problem that I see with this one is the angle used, it does not add interest. Also it doesn''t look completely in focus, or maybe it just a matter of applying sharpness on the editing. 6.</td>', 'if this corn is true, I did not know it exists. The problem that I see with this one is the angle used, it does not add interest. Also it doesn''t look completely in focus, or maybe it just a matter of applying sharpness on the editing. 6.', '2009-11-19 05:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733269, 832794, 84668, '<td valign="top">Looks like magazine photo, well done. Not so well because there is something in the lower right that I don''t know the name, a kind of rose colored line. 6.</td>', 'Looks like magazine photo, well done. Not so well because there is something in the lower right that I don''t know the name, a kind of rose colored line. 6.', '2009-11-19 05:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733270, 833227, 84668, '<td valign="top">It''s somehow lacking impact. I think it''s the composition and contrast that should be improved. A tighter crop would make the composition pop much more, and the lighting is not looking good, part of the fruits are on the shadow. 6.</td>', 'It''s somehow lacking impact. I think it''s the composition and contrast that should be improved. A tighter crop would make the composition pop much more, and the lighting is not looking good, part of the fruits are on the shadow. 6.', '2009-11-19 05:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733272, 833681, 84668, '<td valign="top">The composition is good, the colors are good, well exposed but it''s not impact myself. There is something that I don''t like regarding the details on the pencils. 7.</td>', 'The composition is good, the colors are good, well exposed but it''s not impact myself. There is something that I don''t like regarding the details on the pencils. 7.', '2009-11-19 05:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733274, 833855, 84668, '<td valign="top">The composition is very good, lighting, colors, etc. It''s not big impacting for me but I like it. 7.</td>', 'The composition is very good, lighting, colors, etc. It''s not big impacting for me but I like it. 7.', '2009-11-19 05:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733276, 833852, 84668, '<td valign="top">The lighting is making it look a little bit washed. And in some parts it looks over saturated. The composition is good for me. Also looks like the focus is a little wrong. 6.</td>', 'The lighting is making it look a little bit washed. And in some parts it looks over saturated. The composition is good for me. Also looks like the focus is a little wrong. 6.', '2009-11-19 06:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733277, 833825, 84668, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see it with the very top a little bit more cropped to eliminate the hash light in that part. Also, a deeper depth of field to get the cups more sharp, or even eliminating the cups from the composition, maybe could make it better. 6.</td>', 'I''d like to see it with the very top a little bit more cropped to eliminate the hash light in that part. Also, a deeper depth of field to get the cups more sharp, or even eliminating the cups from the composition, maybe could make it better. 6.', '2009-11-19 06:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733279, 833399, 84668, '<td valign="top">well, the horizon is tilted a little and the rainbow does not pop with that color in the sky. You can''t change the sky but you can choose to not shoot if it''s not worthy. Of course it''s worthy for you since you entered the challenge with it, but the points that I mentioned made me vote it 6.</td>', 'well, the horizon is tilted a little and the rainbow does not pop with that color in the sky. You can''t change the sky but you can choose to not shoot if it''s not worthy. Of course it''s worthy for you since you entered the challenge with it, but the points that I mentioned made me vote it 6.', '2009-11-19 06:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5733281, 833771, 84668, '<td valign="top">This is a good composition but if you planned to do this, you could make the rainbow in the background a little bit more noise free. Also the lower right detracts me from the real subject which should be the pencils, maybe cropping it out would make it better. 6.</td>', 'This is a good composition but if you planned to do this, you could make the rainbow in the background a little bit more noise free. Also the lower right detracts me from the real subject which should be the pencils, maybe cropping it out would make it better. 6.', '2009-11-19 06:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
