(5733287, 833816, 84668, '<td valign="top">not leveled, you can see the ligh reflexes on the water are tilted. Lacks sharpness on the buildings too. Don''t appeal to me. 5.</td>', 'not leveled, you can see the ligh reflexes on the water are tilted. Lacks sharpness on the buildings too. Don''t appeal to me. 5.', '2009-11-19 06:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
