(5736152, 833306, 34659, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t really speak "Rainbow" to me, but I get the arc shapes and there are a lot of colors in the spectrum represented (plus the whole political aspect).  It''s a fantastic shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'This doesn''t really speak "Rainbow" to me, but I get the arc shapes and there are a lot of colors in the spectrum represented (plus the whole political aspect).  It''s a fantastic shot.  Good luck.', '2009-11-21 17:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5736155, 833854, 34659, '<td valign="top">Mind-bending shot.  Good take on the challenge and one of the better executed "pencil/crayon" shots out there.  Nice work.</td>', 'Mind-bending shot.  Good take on the challenge and one of the better executed "pencil/crayon" shots out there.  Nice work.', '2009-11-21 17:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5736157, 833352, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, colorful, natural, and great composition.  Cool reflections too.  The HDR works well.</td>', 'Beautiful, colorful, natural, and great composition.  Cool reflections too.  The HDR works well.', '2009-11-21 17:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5736162, 833887, 34659, '<td valign="top">Bold, in-your-face, and well-executed.  Nice composition.  There are a few jaggies and the shadows are a little harsh from the lighting.  However, this is a strong entry.  Good job. 7</td>', 'Bold, in-your-face, and well-executed.  Nice composition.  There are a few jaggies and the shadows are a little harsh from the lighting.  However, this is a strong entry.  Good job. 7', '2009-11-21 17:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5736166, 833576, 34659, '<td valign="top">Love this...  Great lines of composition and the colors are brilliant.  Beautiful flowing movement and appealing emotion.  This makes me feel "happy". 8</td>', 'Love this...  Great lines of composition and the colors are brilliant.  Beautiful flowing movement and appealing emotion.  This makes me feel "happy". 8', '2009-11-21 17:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5736170, 833878, 34659, '<td valign="top">I think this type of shot is so cool - and you''ve pulled it off well.  Nice touch adding color to the background on the right - it balances the strong color of the reflection in the eye.  Well done. 8</td>', 'I think this type of shot is so cool - and you''ve pulled it off well.  Nice touch adding color to the background on the right - it balances the strong color of the reflection in the eye.  Well done. 8', '2009-11-21 17:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5736171, 833886, 34659, '<td valign="top">This is a nice creative take on the challenge.  It''s extremely well executed too.  Very nicely done and presented.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is a nice creative take on the challenge.  It''s extremely well executed too.  Very nicely done and presented.  Good luck.', '2009-11-21 17:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5736175, 833766, 34659, '<td valign="top">I really like the strong diagonal red &amp; blue lines.  The bubble between containing all of the spectrum is also nicely off-set.  Excellent composition and colors.  Very strong entry. 8</td>', 'I really like the strong diagonal red & blue lines.  The bubble between containing all of the spectrum is also nicely off-set.  Excellent composition and colors.  Very strong entry. 8', '2009-11-21 17:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5736182, 833872, 34659, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Soooo many intricate color variations.  "Threes" always seem to work well from a compositional perspective.  The background colors might seem a tad on the dark side, but don''t detract much from the overall strong statement.  There are a few technical issues that might have come across sharper and brighter, but nice work.  7</td>', 'Cool shot.  Soooo many intricate color variations.  "Threes" always seem to work well from a compositional perspective.  The background colors might seem a tad on the dark side, but don''t detract much from the overall strong statement.  There are a few technical issues that might have come across sharper and brighter, but nice work.  7', '2009-11-21 17:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5736418, 833490, 37845, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite shot in this challenge. Love how the colors just blend together like a colour wheel. Great shot 10.</td>', 'This is my favourite shot in this challenge. Love how the colors just blend together like a colour wheel. Great shot 10.', '2009-11-21 22:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5736419, 833349, 37845, '<td valign="top">The motion, and the leading lines in this shot are just incredible. The only drawback are the little specks of dust here and there. Still a great image. 9</td>', 'The motion, and the leading lines in this shot are just incredible. The only drawback are the little specks of dust here and there. Still a great image. 9', '2009-11-21 22:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
