(5737487, 832667, 34659, '<td valign="top">Knew it had to be you or your wife dude...  She''s sweet as she can be - and she looks perfectly like a young clown in the rainbow wig.  But there was no doubt in my mind that she was the kid we''ve been seeing on the front page!  No shame in sticking with what works!  You''ve got a great formula going and you should keep using it - ''cuz it''s working!<br/> <br/>All formulas aside, it was a colorful, creative, shot that capitalized on the rule of thirds, crisp focus, and strong emotion of the subject.  Well done and congrats again.<br/> <br/>BTW: Do you have any kids who are available for rent?  I could probably se some in my next shoot.  HAAHAA<br/></td>', 'Knew it had to be you or your wife dude...  She''s sweet as she can be - and she looks perfectly like a young clown in the rainbow wig.  But there was no doubt in my mind that she was the kid we''ve been seeing on the front page!  No shame in sticking with what works!  You''ve got a great formula going and you should keep using it - ''cuz it''s working! All formulas aside, it was a colorful, creative, shot that capitalized on the rule of thirds, crisp focus, and strong emotion of the subject.  Well done and congrats again. BTW: Do you have any kids who are available for rent?  I could probably se some in my next shoot.  HAAHAA', '2009-11-23 00:34:04.000000', NULL, 0),
