(5742367, 833681, 97225, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the ribbon. The soda water was a brilliant idea, (you must have used quite a bit!) It makes the image look so fresh and lively.</td>', 'Congratulations on the ribbon. The soda water was a brilliant idea, (you must have used quite a bit!) It makes the image look so fresh and lively.', '2009-11-25 23:06:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5742431, 833674, 102534, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments. The drops were done for real with watercolour paints, not colour added in Photoshop. I tried unwatered watercolours, which were very thick and vibrant, but didnt look like raindrops, and a bit too contrived, so I went for the watery look.</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments. The drops were done for real with watercolour paints, not colour added in Photoshop. I tried unwatered watercolours, which were very thick and vibrant, but didnt look like raindrops, and a bit too contrived, so I went for the watery look.', '2009-11-26 00:46:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5742461, 833855, 18655, '<td valign="top">Nice texture on the steps and perfect with a splash of color from the baloons. The girl is also very appropriate for the scene - dressed nice, good pose and I love her hair color. Well deserved top 10 placing!</td>', 'Nice texture on the steps and perfect with a splash of color from the baloons. The girl is also very appropriate for the scene - dressed nice, good pose and I love her hair color. Well deserved top 10 placing!', '2009-11-26 02:38:56.000000', NULL, 0),
